				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>愛しの　ポケモンたちで
あなたを　クラクラ　させちゃうけど▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T03:20:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
