	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWLEADER5_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アンダー　グラウンド　ボスゥ！！
ヤーコン！　ちのそこから　きたぜえ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T06:54:43" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アンダー　グラウンド　ボスゥ！！
ヤーコン！　地の底から　来たぜえ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T06:54:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
