	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWLEADER8_TRMSG_2ND_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おいの　つよさは
まるで　うみの　ごとく　ひろいけん▽
おはん　きっと　たまげるたい！▼
ろんより　しょうこ！
ほな　はじめよーかい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-15T11:33:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おいの　強さは
まるで　海の　ごとく　広いけん▽
おはん　きっと　たまげるたい！▼
論より　証拠！
ほな　はじめよーかい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-15T11:32:55" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
