	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWLEADER8_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>あらぶる　うみの　ごとく　つよく
おだやかな　うみのように　やさしいの▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-15T11:35:32" />
