		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おはんも　強いが　それでは
海は　びくとも　せんたい！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-15T11:36:23" />
