	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWLEADER8_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たいようが　てらす　うみのおとこッ！
シズイーッ！　すべてを　うけとめろ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T09:06:29" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>太陽が　照らす　海の男ッ！
シズイーッ！　すべてを　受け止めろ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-25T09:06:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：アナウンス
・ジムリーダー：シズイ
・前口上メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T12:29:52" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWLEADER8
スワンジムリーダー・シズイ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T10:14:34" />
		</AttributeCell>
