		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_SWBELL_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>しんじつを　もとめて　すすみつづける
わかき　けんきゅうしゃ　ベルゥッ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T13:09:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>真実を　求めて　進み続ける
若き　研究者　ベルゥッ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-13T13:10:01" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
