		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ハチク『きみは　強い！
いや　きみとポケモンは　強いな！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T07:10:19" />
