	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BWCHAMPION_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_PLAYER_WIN"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アデク『やるでは　ないか！▼
そうだな
いつだって　せかいを　かえるのは▽
ゆめを　ほんきで　おいもとめる　ヤツだ▽
そう！　きみの　ような！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T05:31:33" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アデク『やるでは　ないか！▼
そうだな
いつだって　世界を　変えるのは▽
夢を　本気で　追い求める　ヤツだ▽
そう！　きみの　ような！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T05:31:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・チャンピオン：アデク
・プレイヤーが勝った場合のメッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>CHAMPION
アデク</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T10:18:16" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T07:05:45" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
