		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_BWCHAMPION_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ウルガモスとの　おもいでを　むねに
つよさ　やさしさを　つたえよ　アデク▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
