	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RSLEADER4_TRMSG_1ST_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>かざんの　ちかくで
みがきあげた　ホットな　わざ▽
あなたに　みせてあげるよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>火山の　近くで
磨きあげた　ホットな　技▽
あなたに　みせてあげるよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
