		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RSLEADER5_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>……！　まさか……
まさか　きみに……▽
きみに　まける　とは……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>……！　まさか……
まさか　きみに……▽
きみに　負ける　とは……▼</Text>
