	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RSLEADER6_TRMSG_1ST_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>さあ　わたしと　ポケモンが　おりなす
かれいな　まいを　みせましょう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>さあ　わたしと　ポケモンが　織りなす
華麗な　舞を　みせましょう！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
