	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RSLEADER6_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せかいに　はばたく　とりつかい！
ナギ！　そらたかく　はばたけッー！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
