				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>DPLEADER1
ヒョウタ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
