	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_DPLEADER1_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_PLAYER_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ヒョウタ『ありがとう！▼
これで　とうさんに　いどんでも
かてそうな……　じしんが　ついたよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T06:21:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ヒョウタ『ありがとう！▼
これで　父さんに　挑んでも
勝てそうな……　自信が　ついたよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T06:21:13" />
