		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>りそうを　もとめ　たたかいつづける！
わかき　ポケモントレーナー　チェレン▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T06:04:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-07T05:27:39" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>理想を　求め　戦い続ける！
