	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ASSISTANTM01_TRMSG_2ND_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>わたしの　ポケモンの　どくから
にげられるものなど　いないよ……▽
ふふっ……じっけんかいしだ……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-01T08:10:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>わたしの　ポケモンの　どくから
逃げられる者など　いないよ……▽
ふふっ……実験開始だ……▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-01T08:35:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>２回戦用対戦前メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>毒モブトレーナー
研究員♂</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T05:00:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T07:06:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ASSISTANTM01_TRMSG_3RD_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どくに　かかった　えものが
よわっていく　さまが　だいすきさ……▼
ふふっ　すぐには　おわらせないよ……
じわじわと……　たのしませてくれ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T11:23:59" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どくに　かかった　獲物が
弱っていく　さまが　大好きさ……▼
ふふっ　すぐには　終わらせないよ……
じわじわと……　楽しませてくれ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T11:24:00" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>決勝戦用対戦前メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>毒モブトレーナー
研究員♂</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-01T05:00:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>C</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-08T07:06:33" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>216</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
