	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ASSISTANTM01_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ボツリは　ぶきみに　わらう！
どくを　くらわば　さらまでかぁ！？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-01T09:40:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:19:17" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ボツリは　不気味に　笑う！
どくを　食らわば　皿までかぁ！？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-02T02:02:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:19:33" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：アナウンス
・イベント：アクロマ
・前口上メッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T06:56:28" />
		</CommentCell>
