				Time="2011-09-16T12:31:58" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>武道の　達人ッ！　アラシヤマ！
強敵　求めて　参戦だァ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-05T10:11:34" />
