		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>勝負あり！　うん！
やっぱり　わたしは　強いね！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-05T03:31:53" />
