		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>長年の　研究は……
むだ……　だったのか？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-15T11:28:39" />
