	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_ESPW02_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>れいに　はじまり　れいに　おわる！
れいぎただしき　せんし　ソプラノ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-08T02:45:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-09-16T12:35:19" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>礼に　始まり　礼に　終わる！
礼儀正しき　戦士　ソプラノ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
