		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RENT_SWLEADER5_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まいったね……　いっておくが
オレさま　てかげんは　してねえぞ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-15T03:11:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>まいったね……　いっておくが
オレさま　手加減は　してねえぞ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-15T03:11:26" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
