	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RENT_SWLEADER6_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アナタと　たたかえて　アタシ
つよくなれたから……　ありがとうね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-15T03:12:02" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
