	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RENT_SWLEADER6_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_PLAYER_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>フウロ『ホウエンちほうの
ジムリーダー　ナギさん！▼
あのひとと　おおぞらで　たたかえたら
きっと　たのしいと　おもうの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-15T11:22:25" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>フウロ『ホウエン地方の
ジムリーダー　ナギさん！▼
あの人と　大空で　戦えたら
きっと　楽しいと　思うの！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T11:20:48" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
