	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RENT_SWLEADER7_TRMSG_FIGHT_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>やぶれて　わきあがる
この　あつき　おもい……▽
なんと　いえば　よいのか……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
