	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RENT_SWLEADER7_TRMSG_FIGHT_AFTER_PLAYER_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>シャガ『ものたりぬ！▼
もういちど　ここで　あいまみえるよう
この　シャガと　やくそくだぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
