	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RENT_LEADER7_TRMSG_2ND_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>たたかいに　いどむ　こころの
じゅんび　できているようだな▼
では　いざ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T07:07:51" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>戦いに　挑む　心の
準備　できているようだな▼
では　いざ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-14T12:56:57" />
