	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RENT_RGLEADER5_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ポケモンの　つよさを　ひきだせ！
ナツメなら　それが　できるはず！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
