		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ポケモンの　強さを　ひきだせ！
ナツメなら　それが　できるはず！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-26T13:27:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
