		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いつもと　違う　仲間とでも
勝利を　目指す　アンズだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
