	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RENT_DPLEADER1_TRMSG_2ND_FIGHT_START"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>まいにち　まいにち
かせきを　ほりつづけ▼
きたえに　きたえた　ボクの　すごさを
しょうぶで　みてくれないかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T12:02:58" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:25" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>毎日　毎日
カセキを　掘り続け▼
鍛えに　鍛えた　ボクの　すごさを
勝負で　みてくれないかな？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-01-12T12:03:09" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
