	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_RENT_DPLEADER4_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>つよさが　とわれる　このトーナメント
さあ　どうたたかう　スモモよ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
